#: scenario4:scenario4_888D00E4_5DDF_4A0F_AC21_3C76072CE6C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0443eb5b2545df4b8ab001b22b434443bf0025347f2d0697c74925941d82827f
#. default-sha256: e7a9ab9ad805ea0bb4a156616ee2cb30ecbba2e58fcf84d73e006f19c5c5b45c
